        "title": "The bridge level",
        "blurb": "Where most learners stall — so we spend the most time here. Keigo basics, newspaper headlines, and natural listening speed."
      },
      {
        "title": "Work-ready",
        "blurb": "Business email, interview Japanese, and reading full articles. The level most Japanese employers ask for."
      },
      {
        "title": "No subtitles",
